&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="goals" nodeId="7d4f6e16">&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;March 2017&lt;/strong&gt; - resolved optional inputs
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;May 2016&lt;/strong&gt; - promoted the following work products to core:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        User Support Materials
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Installation Guide
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        User Feedback&amp;nbsp;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;January 2016 -&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;span
    style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&apos;&gt;Fixed
    grammatical and spelling errors for the following tasks&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Conduct peer review
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Updated inputs/outputs for the following tasks:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Configure initial package application
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Configure package solution
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Prepare package application build
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Build enhancement components
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Build form components
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Build workflow components
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Build interface components
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Finalize package software configuration build
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Conduct peer review
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Create release notes
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Demonstrate functionality to users and capture feedback
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop package application components&amp;nbsp;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Replaced existing &quot;develop package components&quot; task with 4 new tasks:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Build interface components
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Build enhancement components
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Build form components
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Build workflow components
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;October 2015 -&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Updated Prepare package application build&amp;nbsp;task
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Updated Create release notes task
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Updated Application Design activity
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;September 2015 -&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Added the following tasks:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Create release notes
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Create installation guide
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Create user support materials
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Added the following new work products:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        User support materials
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;April 2015&lt;/strong&gt; - minor revisions to support release of core method
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;September 2014 -&lt;/strong&gt; This represents our first release of the&amp;nbsp;Package Application
    Development&amp;nbsp;Method. It will serve as a basis for future improvements by our practitioner community.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
